{{Quote|Born for the sea, Sharks move through water without restraint.}}
Shark (formerly known as Fish) is one of the four [[races]] available to new players when joining the game for the first time. It has a 12.5% chance of being assigned at initial spawn.

The Shark race provides significant damage reduction and allows the user to swim in water without taking damage, making it highly defensive. It is recommended for players participating in [[Sea Events|sea events]] for the first time without the [[Leviathan Shield]] accessory or for first-time bounty hunting. Shark is strong against one-shot combos, but its mobility and damage output are lower than other races, making it less suitable for advanced play.

