==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* [[Water]] immunity (or damage reduction for V1).
* Can give a high damage reduction (especially with Awakened [[Buddha]] + [[Water Body]]).
* Great for PvP beginners.

|'''[[Water Body]] (V3)'''
* Good for enduring attacks or combos, virtually rendering a combo useless.

|'''Leviathan's Armor (V4)'''
* Useful against teamers, spammers or trappers for surviving combos.
* Considered the only defense against Gravity's C and V held.

|'''Whirlpool (V4)'''
* Very useful against runners.
* Makes enemies easier to aim.
* Decreases enemies' defense, making them more vulnerable.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* [[Ice]]'s '''Frost Walker''' passive, Awakened [[Magma]]'s '''Magmatic Feet''' passive, Awakened [[Buddha]]'s [Z] ('''Shift'''), Awakened [[Dough]]'s [F] ('''Scorching Donut'''), [[Kitsune]]'s Transformation, [[Gas]]'s Transformation and [[Yeti]]'s Transformation can walk/roll on [[water]], rendering Shark's passive abilities not that useful. However, it still protects from being dragged underwater with these fruits.
* Crossing oceans can be faster with air dashing + use of mobility skill than swimming.
* Non-[[Blox Fruit]] and [[Leviathan Shield]] users might not benefit from the water immunity.
* No movement buff, which makes the player sluggish.
* Considered to be outclassed by several other races in the community. (After being nerfed)
**This is likely false due to the recent changes.

|'''[[Water Body]] (V3)'''
* Some longer [[combos]] can easily counter.

|'''Leviathan's Armor (V4)'''
* Can be ignored by [[Lava]] but somehow takes around half damage and survives longer without reducing overflow.

|'''Whirlpool (V4)'''
* Less useful against enemies that are not running or air campers.
}}
</tabber>

==Notes==
* The V1 extra swim speed is faster than the [[Dinghy]], but slower than the [[Sloop]].
* If the player has put 0 stats in defense, the passive of V1 will make it so you take 1 damage, and the player's health will be stuck at 99/100 hp. Note that this will only work with no defense and also no health-buffing accessories
* The V2 swim speed is slightly faster than the [[Brigade]].
* The Leviathan's Armor effect will sometimes surround the user with a blue aura or a blue layer, depending on the avatar the user is using.
* The Leviathan's Armor aura/layer will get brighter when the overflow bar decreases and disappear when it is gone.
* Leviathan's Armor can be considered as the only defense that [[Gravity]]'s upgraded [V], [C] and Piercing enchantment can't ignore, since it's more of a shield that grants the player extra HP than an actual defense buff measured in units such as percentages.
* This is one of the two races that turns your hair white when in V4, with the other being [[Rabbit]].
* When swimming in the sea with Shark V1, if your health is at 100 MAX (level 1 stats), you will not take any damage if you have a fruit equipped unless you use abilities, in which case you lose a very small amount of health, which will slowly (slower than usual) get back to 99.

